{"v":4,"catch":"尋找Tutankham失落的寶藏！","desc":"《Tutankham》是 KONAMI 於 1982 年發行的動作遊戲。\n這些宏偉的金字塔建於 4,500 年前，內部迷宮般，據說藏有無數寶藏。\n使用水平發射雷射和強大的閃光炸彈來擊退敵人，並進入金字塔深處！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-05-09","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6f9cf1d4ee1948c530984eafdcdfb89dccda6b8bc5a3f5f5fb96d4480cae064.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/629c1f159175ce40aa8e3b454eb34dac6f6e4acf3c95391bad05e6efaf47e836.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/76ad895857d2c87a3177a40d870cc1e27719440a2ef81ea49cd46f792c4e4aab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b973e7b7e1c6b5a3d3cca5512711e97f273934dc55a45503997d3d4650233c4b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a821fd115d022d732bbfb91e5660d07ad87e94c5758c8dc846a02133a0c31e56.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0bbbaf487c3a2ed799f8b43510f38790b7604c9e86abd7901a06128c2a12ad2b.jpg"],"titleId":"010026c01de12000","dlc":[]}